Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.83,0:00:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,TOEI COMPANY, LTD. Presents
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.51,0:00:23.51,Title,,0,0,0,,HAWK OF THE NORTH
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.51,0:00:23.51,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(482,103)}One-Eyed Dragon Masamune
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.90,0:01:54.79,Text,,0,0,0,,TOYOTOMI HIDEYOSHI WAS THE\NGREATEST WARRIOR IN JAPAN.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.81,0:02:01.74,Text,,0,0,0,,HE TOOK ON THE TASK OF UNIFYING\NTHE LAND, TORN BY CIVIL WARS.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.62,0:02:09.79,Text,,0,0,0,,BUT IN NORTHEASTERN JAPAN,\NWARS STILL RAGED ON.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.26,0:02:18.68,Text,,0,0,0,,THERE WAS ONE ESPECIALLY\NDARING YOUNG WARRIOR.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.70,0:02:23.10,Text,,0,0,0,,HE WON EVERY BATTLE HE FOUGHT...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.11,0:02:29.34,Text,,0,0,0,,HE DEFEATED SOMA'S FORCES.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.81,0:02:32.11,Text,,0,0,0,,FUKUSHIMA'S FORCES.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.92,0:02:39.44,Text,,0,0,0,,HE ATTACKED AND CRUSHED\NTHE OUCHI FORCES.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.62,0:02:46.99,Text,,0,0,0,,AND THEN, SET HIS EYES\NON HATAKEYAMA'S LANDS.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.60,0:02:57.51,Text,,0,0,0,,ABOUT THIS TIME, TOYOTOMI\NHIDEYOSHI WAS IN KYOTO.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.88,0:03:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ieyasu is an eyesore\Nand Hojo is an internal pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.12,0:03:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,They make me gloomy enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.83,0:03:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and now I have a swelling on my thigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.00,0:03:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-A swelling on your thigh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.74,0:03:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-Date Masamune.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.21,0:03:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-He's only a country youth\Nand poses no threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.78,0:03:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ieyasu is coming to pay his\Nrespects when his castle is built.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.88,0:03:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Hojo and Date will swear allegiance, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.46,0:03:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-Don't be so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.83,0:03:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Date may join hands with\NHojo and challenge us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.77,0:04:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oba is Date's neighbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.91,0:04:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Transfer him out and put someone else there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.08,0:04:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-Who, Sire?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.08,0:04:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-Let me see...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.43,0:04:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-What? Oba-dono is being transferred?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.34,0:04:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.24,0:04:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-Who is coming in his place?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.61,0:04:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-I do not know, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.78,0:04:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,When his castle is completed Tokugawa Ieyasu
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.65,0:04:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,is coming to Osaka to meet\Nwith the Kanpaku (Regent).
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.82,0:04:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-Meeting with the Regent?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.09,0:04:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ieyasu-dono has made his stand clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.89,0:05:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-If the usually prudent\NTokugawa has forsaken him,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.37,0:05:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hojo won't last long.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.07,0:05:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-Meaning, we should do as Tokugawa does?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.94,0:05:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.81,0:05:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Our situation is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.38,0:05:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Tokugawa's lands lie between\Nthose of the Regent and Hojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.59,0:05:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-But we are being watched continually...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.59,0:05:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Nikaido, Ashina and Satake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.70,0:05:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They are all the Regent's\Ntrusted right-hand men.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.34,0:05:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hatakeyama and Oba were\Nthe only ones who weren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.21,0:05:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And Oba is being transferred.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.75,0:05:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If the wrong man comes,\Na serious situation may arise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.49,0:06:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Lord Tamura's messenger came!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.73,0:06:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-Tamura's messenger?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.97,0:06:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Masamune?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.07,0:06:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Call Masamune!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.29,0:06:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hey! Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.49,0:06:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see?\NGet off the horse and put them back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.46,0:06:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no manners, samurai?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.14,0:06:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If you haven't, then you're\Nnot a man, but a beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.84,0:06:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-What are they for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.64,0:06:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-What are they for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.21,0:06:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,For firewood of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.62,0:07:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-Are you taking them far?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.65,0:07:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-I'm taking them to the Hakuja\NHot Springs beyond this pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.64,0:07:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.87,0:07:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the first time I've passed\Nhere without a load.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.25,0:07:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-You live at the spa?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.85,0:07:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-Just a little further on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.62,0:07:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Not used to these roads, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.52,0:07:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.83,0:07:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hungry, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.27,0:07:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It may not taste very good,\Nbut do you want to try it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.31,0:08:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-I'll eat it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.18,0:08:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-Go ahead.\NYou helped me so I'm not hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.82,0:08:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Any good?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.33,0:08:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.80,0:08:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-A samurai who likes millet.\NYou show some promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.57,0:08:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You may go far one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.14,0:08:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-Will I? How far?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.08,0:08:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-Let me see...\NIf things go well, you may even
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.92,0:08:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,become a lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.22,0:08:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do become a lord,\Nwhat will you do first?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.10,0:08:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-I'll gain more land.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.66,0:09:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-Fool!\NDon't become a lord with such ideas!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.70,0:09:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-No?\N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.01,0:09:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You would have to fight to gain more land!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.54,0:09:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Then fields would be wasted\Nand houses burned!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.71,0:09:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,War hits the masses most!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.88,0:09:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-But I must fight if a war is forced on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.19,0:09:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-In that case, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.92,0:09:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight wars to end wars.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.73,0:09:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Make the country peaceful\Nas soon as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.04,0:09:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-Old man, I'll take them down for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.71,0:09:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Your lunch tasted good. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.58,0:09:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-If you like millet rice so much,\Nyou can come anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.32,0:09:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Hakuja Hot Springs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.53,0:10:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-It seems to be a peaceful place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.30,0:10:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-It seems a wounded snake\Nbathed in the spa there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.97,0:10:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it got its name.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.09,0:10:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-My lord! My lord!\NYour father wants you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.63,0:10:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.46,0:10:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-Lord Tamura's messenger came!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.30,0:10:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.11,0:10:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-No, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.54,0:10:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Tamura-dono's message was about marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.98,0:10:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-Marriage...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.05,0:10:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-He wishes you to marry his Princess Mego.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.85,0:11:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-We've lived together for a\Ndecade since your mother died.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.79,0:11:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Life becomes cut and dry without women.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.47,0:11:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time you married.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.87,0:11:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A clan lord needs a wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.87,0:11:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.18,0:11:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-That is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.81,0:11:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Tamura Kiyoaki is a descendent\Nof Tamuramaro, a great general.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.32,0:11:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a good match.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.49,0:11:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-I won't.\N-Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.29,0:11:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-I will not be a political tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.86,0:11:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-What? Will you explain?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.90,0:11:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.\NTokugawa-dono has abandoned Hojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.87,0:11:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Tamura-dono is Hojo's kin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.67,0:11:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It is clear why he wishes a\Nmarriage with our Date family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.48,0:12:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-You are very harsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.05,0:12:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-I hate father for using me as a pawn!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.66,0:12:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.03,0:12:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-You may be right, Young lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.70,0:12:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-Don't call me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.03,0:12:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,My real reason is different\Nfrom what I told father.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.61,0:12:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-What is your real reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.91,0:12:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.82,0:12:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It is because the girl is bound to be ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.49,0:12:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.90,0:12:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Kojuro should teach you\Nnot to tease your nurse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.27,0:12:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-I'm not. It's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.87,0:13:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-Princess Mego is arriving in a day or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.18,0:13:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,See for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.38,0:13:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-She is?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.72,0:13:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes. Outwardly, it is to\Naccompany her father to Odawara.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.36,0:13:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,She will stop by here to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.03,0:13:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-I won't see her! I won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.38,0:14:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-Young lord, please show her your hawk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.31,0:14:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-A hawk in the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.59,0:14:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-Would you like to see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.15,0:14:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, please show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.09,0:14:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's the finest hawk in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.03,0:14:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-Please come.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.81,0:15:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-She's very beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.75,0:15:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, this is the first time I've\Never seen someone so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.52,0:15:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-My sister expects you to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.93,0:15:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-There are always exceptions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.46,0:15:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-She will not take excuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.76,0:15:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-Nurse is stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.77,0:15:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-I, Katakura Kojuro, agree with my sister.\NI'm in favor of the match, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.11,0:15:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-Who said I would marry her?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.07,0:15:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-She is ideal for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.04,0:15:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, she's almost too perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.72,0:15:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-Why not, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.29,0:16:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-My life will be a stormy one,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.36,0:16:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,and I will not live to a ripe old age.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.61,0:16:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-Wada Nariuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.07,0:16:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe he is the lord\Nof Nagahama Castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.91,0:16:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, with a fief of 13,000 koku.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.28,0:16:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-He is not a great lord,\Nbut he has power behind him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.79,0:16:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-You wish to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.16,0:16:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-Wada Nariuki has replaced Oba-dono.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.77,0:16:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-Wada Nariuki...\NI heard that he is Ishida Mitsunari's kin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.64,0:16:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-Regent Toyotomi is behind Mitsunari-dono.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.01,0:17:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-Wada has been sent as their spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.85,0:17:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-They may have worse plans than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.52,0:17:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.72,0:17:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-He may stir up trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.40,0:17:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter who our neighbor is,\Nour road stretches straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.80,0:17:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-Masamune...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.14,0:17:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-Don't worry, father.\NI know your pet theory!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.68,0:17:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A warrior's best method\Nis to win without fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.48,0:17:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-Put it into practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.42,0:17:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I live,\NI will try to avoid wars.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.96,0:17:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-But in the long run,\Nwe may have to fight at times!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.33,0:17:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-There you go again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.30,0:17:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That reminds me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.73,0:17:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What answer shall I give to Tamura-dono?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.81,0:17:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-I already declined.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.94,0:18:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.88,0:18:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you refuse
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.31,0:18:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Tamura said he wouldn't\Ntake the princess back...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.72,0:18:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's his privilege.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.82,0:18:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,When is Wada Nariuki-dono coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.02,0:18:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-Sir! He has passed Utsunomiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.21,0:18:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-Farmers! You're in the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.75,0:18:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-Go on, move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.72,0:18:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.72,0:18:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-A boundary line!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.42,0:18:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-Boundary line?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.89,0:18:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is Lord Date's land!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.23,0:18:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-Insolent fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.23,0:18:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Men like you force us to make it\Nclear that it is Lord Wada's land.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.67,0:19:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Step back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.34,0:19:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I said stand aside!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.41,0:19:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I warn you not to wander\Naround here after this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.18,0:19:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that sign!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.98,0:19:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,DO NOT CUT TREES WITHOUT\NPERMISSION - LORD WADA
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.76,0:19:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-What does it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.29,0:19:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-You are not to touch Lord Wada's trees!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.53,0:19:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You will be punished if you do!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.87,0:19:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not even touch the\Nleaves without permission!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.24,0:19:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-We have no firewood!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.98,0:19:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-It has always been Lord Date's land!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.32,0:19:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-Clear out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.01,0:20:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-He made his move?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.18,0:20:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-Fight, if you must?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.74,0:20:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-No...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.51,0:20:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wada Nariuki knows what an\Noutrageous thing he's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.39,0:20:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants trouble between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.53,0:20:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Kanpaku-dono can act.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.37,0:20:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.00,0:20:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Call Yamagami.\N-Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.06,0:21:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's the truth! Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.86,0:21:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this! How about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.14,0:21:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-What does it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.27,0:21:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-Lord Date's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.04,0:21:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Move to his land by April 6th.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.34,0:21:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll give each of you land and\Nexempt taxes for a whole year.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.52,0:21:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,An entire year with no taxes.\NHow does that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.39,0:21:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-Sounds like a dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.62,0:21:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-No, and this is the proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.99,0:21:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-I'm grateful! I'll get ready to move!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.16,0:21:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-Wait, you can't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.33,0:21:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's against the law and you'll be punished!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.34,0:21:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-I don't care. I'd starve to death here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.77,0:21:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go and see for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.71,0:22:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,"MOVE TO LORD DATE'S LAND BY APRIL 6\NAND TAXES ARE EXEMPT FOR ONE YEAR"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.97,0:23:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-One hundred and forty five people came,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.91,0:23:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,but one hundred were caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.21,0:23:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe about three hundred\Nmore wish to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.25,0:23:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.62,0:23:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What will Wada Nariuki report to the Regent?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.26,0:23:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-There's a forest fire near the boundary line!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.60,0:23:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-Was it arson?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.96,0:24:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-The farmers must have done\Nit to rescue their friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.69,0:24:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-The farmers were tricked\Nby the promise of land,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.73,0:25:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,and the exemption of taxes!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.56,0:25:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.50,0:25:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You said they were tricked?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.40,0:25:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.37,0:25:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-Is that your word or your lord's?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.24,0:25:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Think carefully before you reply!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.41,0:25:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The farmers are the mainstay of this country!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.22,0:25:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll overlook it if you didn't mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.92,0:25:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But, if you speak for Wada-dono,\NI can't excuse it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.66,0:25:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You said they ran away, but\Ndo you know the law about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.41,0:25:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who run away will be punished!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.28,0:25:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And, also the clan from which they flee!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.22,0:26:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, or you'll advertise\Nyour failure to other clans.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.82,0:26:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-My lord, I'm sure he's\Nacquainted with the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.60,0:26:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-What? Are you saying he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.96,0:26:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.97,0:26:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The farmers didn't run away.\NThey were on Date land.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.91,0:26:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.78,0:26:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.81,0:26:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.92,0:26:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It was my mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.30,0:26:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see. You may go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.89,0:27:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mitsunari, it seems you\Nlost in the battle of wits.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.73,0:27:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He slapped your face and\Nthen sent me this hawk.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.28,0:27:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,A bold youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.58,0:27:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Like the sender, it must be watched, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.02,0:27:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Mitsunari...\NI am beginning to get worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.89,0:27:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.33,0:27:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-Jurakudai has been\Nbuilt to my satisfaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.00,0:28:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing left is to gain\Nthe reins of government.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.24,0:28:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an eyesore.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.25,0:28:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-That swelling?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.45,0:28:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, there's a youth in Oshu who\Ncan even make Ishida Mitsunari froth.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.89,0:28:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about it.\NI'm very worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.52,0:30:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-My Lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.66,0:30:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.16,0:32:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,My Lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.55,0:33:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-Gen'an!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.78,0:33:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.99,0:33:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-Will I ever see you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.82,0:33:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-Of course you will, My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.06,0:33:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But the wound must heal first.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.83,0:33:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So both eyes must be bandaged\Nto shut out the light for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.57,0:34:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Please keep the room dark for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.93,0:34:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.20,0:34:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-It is I.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.34,0:34:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.47,0:34:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-Does it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.34,0:34:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.95,0:34:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What did Gen'an say?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.48,0:34:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-He said it's not serious as\Nlong as the wound heals.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.03,0:35:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The men searched to see if\Nany proof had been left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.03,0:35:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But they found none.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.03,0:35:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We know who is behind it,\Nbut we're helpless.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.14,0:35:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish we had caught at\Nleast one of their men.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.55,0:35:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I regret it very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.59,0:36:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.65,0:36:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-I thought all you needed was a\Ntongue and a nose to taste food.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.76,0:36:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But the eyes are important, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.70,0:36:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Tea doesn't taste good when I\Nmust rely on my memory for its color.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.04,0:37:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's because I didn't make it well enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.12,0:37:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Please rest now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.52,0:37:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-Nurse.\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.76,0:37:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-You're not hiding anything from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.46,0:37:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Is my eye hopeless by any chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.70,0:37:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-Young lord.\NOf course not
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.71,0:37:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.36,0:37:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's started to rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.07,0:38:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hear the raindrops.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.81,0:38:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Nurse...\N-Young lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.92,0:38:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-I wish to go out.\N-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.23,0:38:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-The irises must be pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.73,0:39:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't recall the color of the flowers...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.18,0:39:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter how I try.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.37,0:40:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-I can't tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.78,0:40:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He has a stout heart,\Nbut he's only 23 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.82,0:40:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be cruel to tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.49,0:40:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's worse to not tell him\Nhe'll be blind in one eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.66,0:40:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-Then you tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.97,0:40:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have the heart to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.30,0:41:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-Is it alright to be out in the light?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.80,0:41:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-My heart feels light again and\NI just can't stand being cooped up.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.48,0:41:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought nature could\Nbe as beautiful as it is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.19,0:41:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine how lovely\Nit would be with both eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.59,0:41:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-Joy and sorrow differ with one's lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.46,0:41:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Happiness is where the heart finds it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.00,0:41:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-Young lord...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.77,0:41:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The doctor is waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.44,0:42:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-I'll know today when the bandage comes off.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.21,0:42:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-I'll take your bandage off\Nthe day after tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.45,0:42:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-Day after tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.35,0:42:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's sooner than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.59,0:42:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-Wounds heal quickly when one is young.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.33,0:42:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.60,0:42:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Nurse...\N-Young lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.27,0:42:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-Tell father!\N-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.83,0:44:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Young lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.30,0:44:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-Go away! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.54,0:44:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-Young lord! Why...\NWhy did you take the bandage off?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.25,0:44:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-Nurse...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.25,0:44:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,you knew and you didn't tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.15,0:44:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-Forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.52,0:45:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-Father, Kojuro, everyone knew!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.03,0:45:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Only I didn't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.67,0:45:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-Young lord...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.80,0:45:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-What are you staring at?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.84,0:45:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you pity me so much?\NGo away!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.31,0:45:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-Young lord...!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.81,0:45:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.29,0:45:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think I'd be sad if you told me?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.49,0:45:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You thought I was that weak?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.89,0:45:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.60,0:45:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sorry about my eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.40,0:45:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm bitter because no one told me!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.47,0:45:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes me seethe inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.91,0:46:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can defeat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.22,0:46:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid to lose an eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.29,0:46:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost an eye but the Date Clan is safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.34,0:46:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't lose...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.52,0:47:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-He's stayed in his room for 20 days\Nnow. He won't let anyone near him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.20,0:47:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-He won't even talk to Katakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.10,0:47:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-Did you see his eye?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.44,0:47:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-No.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.94,0:47:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-Would you like to go hunting?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.11,0:47:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear the hawk you\Ncaught is ready to hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.45,0:47:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-Father, why didn't you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.66,0:47:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You said happiness was of the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.36,0:47:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me that I'd be blind?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.97,0:47:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-Forgive me...\NI just couldn't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.24,0:48:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-I'm bitter because everyone kept it from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.85,0:48:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-Masamune!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.90,0:49:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.27,0:49:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ill?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.84,0:49:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want some water?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.14,0:49:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.54,0:49:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Begone!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.22,0:49:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.07,0:50:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-Old man! Old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.87,0:50:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, you're that...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.41,0:50:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-Give me some millet rice.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.64,0:50:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.55,0:50:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to your eye?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.58,0:50:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.59,0:50:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You big fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.96,0:50:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Your parents gave you your body!\NDon't abuse it!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.13,0:50:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm glad it wasn't both eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.47,0:50:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's go to my house and\NI'll feed you some millet rice.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.94,0:51:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Tie your horse here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.34,0:51:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.16,0:51:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-You know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.76,0:51:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, I met him at the pass earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.93,0:51:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.03,0:51:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,These days, young people move fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.71,0:51:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Chi yo, my granddaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.54,0:51:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This samurai is...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.31,0:52:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, what is your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.65,0:52:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-Masanosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.45,0:52:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-Masanosuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.12,0:52:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chi yo... He likes millet rice.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.89,0:52:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Give him a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.30,0:52:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.81,0:52:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be used to\Npoverty to like millet rice.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.68,0:52:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.76,0:52:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-I must work first or it won't taste good.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.76,0:52:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-See?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.73,0:52:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-I'm sorry I shouted at you earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.60,0:52:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-I was frightened.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.90,0:53:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-He fights even if he loses an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.18,0:53:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.71,0:53:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's alright. I fed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.70,0:53:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-Did you find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.70,0:53:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-Sir... We only know that he rode\Npast the Otakemura Highroad.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.74,0:53:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-Search thoroughly!\N-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.38,0:55:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-What was that song?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.28,0:55:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's the weeders' song.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.89,0:55:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.09,0:55:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-The money for the horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.86,0:55:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-Give it to the old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.53,0:55:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.40,0:55:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.17,0:55:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-He went to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.10,0:55:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.77,0:55:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,When did your parents die?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.41,0:55:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-They were killed five years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.98,0:55:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-Killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.42,0:56:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-During the civil war.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.32,0:56:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-Your father wasn't a samurai,\Nso why was he killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.76,0:56:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-Because he didn't hand over any rice.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.93,0:56:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But he really didn't have any.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.54,0:56:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So he was finally...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.48,0:56:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Iran as fast as I could\Nto my grandfather here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.62,0:56:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-You hate wars then?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.09,0:56:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.66,0:56:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-Do you hate samurai?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.87,0:56:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Be frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.67,0:56:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-I hate them!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.80,0:57:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-Wait!\N-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.77,0:57:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-Look at all the horses!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.74,0:58:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-Please return with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.18,0:58:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.81,0:58:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-You must.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.88,0:58:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-Kojuro...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.58,0:58:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I've begun to see\Nwhat I never saw before.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.02,0:58:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I see with my one eye what\NI didn't see when I had two.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.80,0:58:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I must probe it more.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.44,0:58:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.08,0:58:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-This hawk does not like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.75,0:58:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Mitsunari, are you ready to attack Hojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.79,0:58:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, sir. Eight daimyo, including Tokugawa...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.66,0:59:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,They are ready to attack with\Na total force of 300,000 men.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.51,0:59:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-It will mean the end of\Nthe illustrious Hojo family.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.95,0:59:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stir up trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.95,0:59:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll look like we're worried\Nabout the Date Clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.92,0:59:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-Supreme lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.69,0:59:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-There's no hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.86,0:59:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-But he's a continual eyesore.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.60,0:59:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-And he only has one eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.37,0:59:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-I regret that my men failed to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.81,0:59:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-Watch, while I kill Date with\Nthe same sword that kills Hojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.22,1:00:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I must have a showdown with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.46,1:00:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Either I kill him, or I\Nwin him over to my side.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.80,1:00:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-Do you hate the men\Nwho made you like this?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.54,1:00:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.54,1:00:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-But you're to blame, too, for fighting.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.62,1:00:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.65,1:00:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-Why side with him?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.69,1:00:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-We wouldn't have met\Nif you had both eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.50,1:00:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you angry?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.10,1:00:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.51,1:00:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-You caught one!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.85,1:00:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.86,1:01:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you thinking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.90,1:01:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-I'm so confused.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.57,1:01:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-About what?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.54,1:01:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-About you, Masanosuke-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.05,1:01:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I was afraid of you at first, fighting and all.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.08,1:01:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But not now.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.65,1:01:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You wear nice clothes, have a\Nhorse and swords, but no money.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.29,1:01:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And those samurai came yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.03,1:01:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.63,1:01:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.57,1:01:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.38,1:02:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-I'd like you to stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.15,1:02:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.86,1:02:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-Chi yo...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.26,1:02:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to remain here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.20,1:02:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-Masanosuke-san...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.67,1:02:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.48,1:02:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We have guests!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.35,1:02:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-The samurai from yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.19,1:02:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-Chi yo, Chi yo... you'd better not go!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.10,1:02:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-Young lord!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.25,1:03:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-What brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.76,1:03:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-To visit you, Young lord, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.50,1:03:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.17,1:03:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-I am glad you are well now.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.61,1:03:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-I have become a one-eyed man.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.85,1:03:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-I hear it has opened\Nup new worlds to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.46,1:03:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-Why did you bring her here?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.46,1:03:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-How can you say such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.10,1:04:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The princess has come a long way.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.40,1:04:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You have not said a kind word to her,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.84,1:04:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,yet hint for her to leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.87,1:04:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stand it!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.64,1:04:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-It is I who can't!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.54,1:04:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You and Kojuro are meddlesome.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.65,1:04:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I declined to marry Princess\NMego from the beginning!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.76,1:04:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-But I have chosen you for my\Nhusband ever since I met you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.47,1:04:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mountain roads are bad.\NGo back before it gets dark.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.94,1:04:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Nurse, take her.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.01,1:04:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-Young lord! Young lord!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.61,1:05:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.88,1:05:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to Chi yo?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.98,1:05:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-She left, My lord.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.59,1:05:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-Where'd she go?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.39,1:05:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-To her aunt's house in Mito.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.99,1:05:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord... Please wait, please wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.36,1:05:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't go!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.50,1:05:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll feel sorry for her\Nif you bring her back.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.87,1:05:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,A lord and a mountain girl...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.55,1:05:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,it would only end in tragedy!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.08,1:06:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Please! I beg you not to go!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.24,1:07:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-My lord, the Regent is marching\Ntowards Odawara!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.38,1:07:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-What?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.35,1:07:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-Please return!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.12,1:07:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord! You must not think only of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.16,1:07:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The fate of your vassals and\Npeople rests on your shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.23,1:07:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot avoid it!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.31,1:08:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-What's the Oshu badger doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.81,1:08:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come to\Nget rid of the swelling.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.96,1:08:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-This is no time to think!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.76,1:08:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your men and join\Nthe Kanpaku-dono's forces.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.63,1:08:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yamagami... How many days to Odawara?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.97,1:08:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-Sir. At least ten days.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.87,1:08:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ten days?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.67,1:08:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the Regent's forces?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.11,1:08:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-They have passed Okazaki.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.08,1:08:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-We're too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.78,1:08:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-We must hurry and join him.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.25,1:08:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He will pardon us if we\Ngo before Odawara falls.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.69,1:08:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-My lord, there is no need\Nto fear the Regent so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.73,1:09:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,If Kanpaku-dono forces us to,\Nwe will fight like Oshu samurai.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.04,1:09:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-No, no. I wish to avoid a war which\Nwould involve and kill my people.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.34,1:09:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Masamune, what is your opinion?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.48,1:09:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-There is no need to go to Odawara.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.26,1:09:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-You will fight the Regent?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.16,1:09:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-No, Kanpaku-dono will not wage war on us.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.07,1:09:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-What?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.20,1:09:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-He's after Hojo.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.50,1:09:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So he won't attack us.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.38,1:09:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If the Regent is the man I think he is...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.98,1:09:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He will not fight us.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.32,1:09:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-That may be so.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.25,1:10:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But to be absolutely safe,\Nit would be best to join him.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.49,1:10:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-Reporting! The Hatakeyama\Nforces have invaded our land!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.57,1:10:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-What?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.85,1:11:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-Don't retreat! Attack them!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.73,1:11:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't retreat!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.86,1:11:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-Send his man back\Nand defeat Hatakeyama!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.77,1:11:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-But he says Hatakeyama\Nwill bow to our conditions.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.14,1:11:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-Conditions?\NWar is not a business transaction!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.88,1:12:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It is either smash, or be\Nsmashed by the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.78,1:12:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, but there are many\Nways to smash the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.32,1:12:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The best way is to win without\Nshedding unnecessary blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.30,1:12:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-No, unless we kill Hatakeyama,\Nhe will always be at our throats!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.57,1:12:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The sacrifices will be greater if you wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.01,1:12:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-You don't know how a liege lord should act!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.91,1:12:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-I'd rather not know!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.52,1:12:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.28,1:12:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare a son of mine say that!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.75,1:12:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot call yourself a lord\Nif you forget the people's welfare.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.16,1:12:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-Father, we must kill him for our\Npeople's welfare and to stop wars.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.17,1:12:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hatakeyama isn't as\Nimportant as the Regent.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.84,1:13:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We must go to Odawara.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.41,1:13:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What if we make the fatal error of being late?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.11,1:13:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-Father, why do you curry\Nfavor with the Regent?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.68,1:13:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.22,1:13:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But he has the help of Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.19,1:13:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do all the clans gather about him?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.10,1:13:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It means ruin to defy Heaven's will\Nand disappoint our people.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.08,1:14:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-I have agreed to all your conditions.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.38,1:14:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take a look.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.60,1:15:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.60,1:15:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-Then...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.34,1:15:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-This is an outrage! Guards! Guards!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.05,1:15:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-Stand back!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.25,1:15:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take Lord Date as hostage\Nand wait for a new truce.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.20,1:15:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-Shoot me and keep the\NDate honor unsullied!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.24,1:15:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot me!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.87,1:15:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.74,1:15:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord! My lord...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.84,1:16:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-My lord...! My lord!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.64,1:16:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord... My lord...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.68,1:16:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hatakeyama took your father!\N-Damn it!!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.72,1:19:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-My lord.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.60,1:19:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-Father!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.55,1:19:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-My lord...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.10,1:20:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-Father... Father, forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.51,1:20:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to uphold the honor of our family!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.50,1:20:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Kojuro, hang Hatakeyama\Nup for three days and nights!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.21,1:21:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-Masamune, the Date name is\Nuntarnished because of you...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.92,1:21:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I am very happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.85,1:22:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-Kojuro... Kojuro are you here?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.78,1:22:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.62,1:22:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-Prepare to leave for Odawara!\N-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.08,1:23:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,HONJIN\N(Headquarters)
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.71,1:23:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-They're keeping us waiting.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.68,1:23:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They've made us wait for three days...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.85,1:23:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's outrageous!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.89,1:23:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-Our fate depends on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.72,1:23:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's be patient.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.73,1:23:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-Sagara reporting.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.96,1:24:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-How is the Oshu hawk?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.30,1:24:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-Calm and composed.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.64,1:24:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-He only has one eye,\Nbut he has keen perception.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.61,1:24:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Mitsunari, shall I see him?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.80,1:24:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Masamune, are you bitter\Ntowards the man who did that?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.71,1:24:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-I was.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.21,1:24:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-You were, but are not now?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.15,1:24:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.95,1:24:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand things better with one eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.76,1:25:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had both eyes...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.53,1:25:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid we would never have met.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.47,1:25:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-You may be right.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.77,1:25:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,-Kanpaku-dono...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.11,1:25:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The man who failed to kill me...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.74,1:25:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you not think he\Nis very bitter about it?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.99,1:26:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-He is Lord Date, the mighty daimyo.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.96,1:26:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-Only one eye, but a fine lord.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.43,1:27:18.50,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs100\pos(468,387)}THE END
